#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from"
" `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to "
"`.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-"
"labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr ""

